{"turn_id": "d11-t1", "session_id": "d11", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "models_evaluated", "text": "该数据集使用两个已发表的编码器-解码器图像描述模型进行训练与评估：Neural Image Captioning (NIC) 模型，以及 Yunjey 的 Pytorch-tutorial 图像描述模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "architecture", "text": "这些模型采用 CNN 提取图像特征作为编码器，并用 RNN-LSTM 作为解码器。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "models_compared", "text": "结果报告了两种模型（Pytorch-tutorial 与 NIC - Show and Tell）在 English-sportball、GT-sportball 和 UIT-ViIC 三个数据集上的表现。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-721ac9d3e099bacb12ac84aa"}]}, {"key": "metrics", "text": "评估使用 BLEU、ROUGE 和 CIDEr 指标。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-94b848c452b3746ffb5c659d"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d11-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d11-t2", "session_id": "d11", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "models_used", "text": "论文用两个已发表的、采用编码器-解码器架构的图像描述模型进行训练和评估：Neural Image Captioning (NIC) 模型和 Yunjey 的 Pytorch-tutorial 图像描述模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "architecture", "text": "整体架构中，先由 CNN 提取图像特征作为编码器部分，以向量表示的图像特征用作解码层的输入；解码器部分使用 RNN-LSTM 将向量映射为目标句子。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "metrics", "text": "论文通过 BLEU、ROUGE 和 CIDEr 指标来验证和比较 NIC 模型与 Yunjey 的 Pytorch-tutorial 模型在该语料上的结果。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-94b848c452b3746ffb5c659d"}]}, {"key": "evaluation_scope", "text": "论文将两个模型在 UIT-ViIC 上的结果与原始 MS-COCO 中 sportball 类别的英语数据集进行比较，并与由不同方法构建的两个越南语数据集进行比较。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-bbd4db15d6773cfa30848a4a"}, {"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-df82acb31723d02ba4213f1a"}]}, {"key": "result_comparison", "text": "作者总结称，英语集仅在 BLEU-1 指标上优于越南语集，而越南语集在 BLEU-2 至 BLEU-4，尤其是 CIDEr 分数上表现良好。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-df82acb31723d02ba4213f1a"}]}, {"key": "manual_vs_google", "text": "论文称，将 UIT-ViIC 与使用谷歌翻译生成描述的数据集比较时，评估结果和输出示例表明谷歌翻译服务表现尚可接受，但多数翻译描述并不十分自然和符合语言习惯，因此作者认为目前更倾向于使用人工撰写的越南语数据集描述。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-df82acb31723d02ba4213f1a"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d11-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d11-t3", "session_id": "d11", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "uit_models_used", "text": "UIT-ViIC 论文使用两个基于编码器-解码器架构的已发表图像描述模型进行训练和评估：Neural Image Captioning (NIC) 模型，以及 Yunjey 的 Pytorch-tutorial 图像描述模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "uit_model_architecture", "text": "在 UIT-ViIC 的实验中，编码器部分先用 CNN 提取图像特征，解码器部分使用 RNN-LSTM 将向量嵌入为目标句子。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "uit_performance", "text": "UIT-ViIC 摘要及结论仅总体说明在深度神经网络模型上评估数据集并与其他数据集比较，英文集仅在 BLEU-1 上优于越南语集，越南语集在 BLEU-2 至 BLEU-4 尤其 CIDEr 上表现较好；所给证据未提供微调模型在该数据集上的具体数值性能。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-df82acb31723d02ba4213f1a"}, {"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-bbd4db15d6773cfa30848a4a"}]}, {"key": "seva_model_used", "text": "SEVA 论文选择 BERT 进行概念识别，使用其预训练的 cased 语言模型，基于 pytorch transformers 和 hugging face 的 BertForTokenClassification 做多类分类，并进行完整微调。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "seva_additional_model", "text": "SEVA 还使用 spaCy 实现概念识别，并得到相似结果。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "seva_performance", "text": "SEVA 中微调后的 BERT 模型在概念识别任务上取得 F1 分数 0.89，训练与评估采用 80-20 数据划分。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "not_comparable", "text": "两篇论文的任务与数据集不同（SEVA 为系统工程概念识别的词级标注 token 分类，UIT-ViIC 为越南语图像描述数据集评估），模型与指标也不同（BERT 用 F1，图像描述模型用 BLEU/CIDEr），因此两者性能不具备可比性。证据分别描述各自设置，未提供跨论文可直接比较的基准。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-7e9b5fdcd1b735fa2b7de65a"}, {"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}, {"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}, {"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-df82acb31723d02ba4213f1a"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d11-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
